<h3 id="project1">Project 1:Touchless full home automatic system</h3>
**Touchless Full Home Automation System Using Hand Gestures**
- Developed a touchless home automation system to control fan speed and bulb brightness through hand gestures.
- Implemented real-time hand detection using Python, OpenCV, and MediaPipe with a laptop camera.
- Integrated ESP32 with L298N2A motor drivers to regulate fan speed and bulb brightness using PWM control.
- Connected the system to ThingSpeak for IoT-based data visualization and tracking of appliance parameters.
- Designed a cost-effective, contactless, and user-friendly solution to improve convenience and accessibility in smart home automation.

